---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import Sponsors from '../components/Sponsors.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import {emailLink} from '../data/festival';
---
<Layout title="Sponsors & Sponsorship | Breck Sky Fest" description="Meet Breck Sky Fest’s Intergalactic, Interstellar, Interplanetary, and Orbital sponsor tiers and explore support for the first festival.">
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Thank you for helping Breck look up" title="A shared sky. A community effort." description="Support for the first Breck Sky Fest helps turn a good idea into telescope time, student discoveries, and a weekend the community can enjoy." icon="stars"/>
  <section class="section paper-section"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">2026 festival sponsors</span><h2 class="sponsors-heading">Our supporters.</h2><Sponsors/></div></section>
  <section class="section dark-section" id="become-a-sponsor"><div class="wrap intro-split"><div><span class="eyebrow">Become a sponsor</span><h2>How far do you<br/>want to go?</h2></div><div><p class="large">A first view of Saturn. A science question that stays with a student. A family spending an evening together outside.</p><p>We’re looking for sponsors who want to help build those experiences in Breckenridge. Sponsorship ranges from <strong>Orbital</strong> support for local participation through <strong>Interplanetary</strong>, <strong>Interstellar</strong>, and our highest <strong>Intergalactic</strong> tier.</p><a class="button" href={emailLink('Sponsorship inquiry','Hi Luke,\n\nI would like to discuss sponsoring Breck Sky Fest.\n\nBusiness or organization:\nArea of interest or preferred tier (Orbital / Interplanetary / Interstellar / Intergalactic):\nFinancial or in-kind support we could offer:\nQuestions:\n')}>Talk sponsorship <Icon name="arrow" size={20}/></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section paper-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Sponsorship levels</span><h2>Choose your<br/>distance.</h2></div><p class="section-aside">The names get bigger as the scale of support grows. Exact benefits and recognition can be shaped around the part of the festival you want to help make possible.</p></div><div class="support-grid"><div><span>01 / Orbital</span><h3>Local support, close to home.</h3><p>Entry-level financial or in-kind support from local businesses, makers, and community partners.</p></div><div><span>02 / Interplanetary</span><h3>Help a program travel farther.</h3><p>Support a meaningful piece of the festival such as an activity, student component, hospitality, or equipment need.</p></div><div><span>03 / Interstellar</span><h3>Back a major festival experience.</h3><p>Significant support for a major program or festival-wide need, with prominent recognition.</p></div><div><span>04 / Intergalactic</span><h3>Help shape the first year.</h3><p>Top-level support for organizations that want a major founding presence across Breck Sky Fest.</p></div></div><div class="section-heading" style="margin-top:72px"><div><span class="eyebrow">Where support can help</span><h2>Choose a part<br/>of the story.</h2></div><p class="section-aside">Contributions and recognition will be agreed with each sponsor. We can discuss a financial contribution, useful equipment, materials, hospitality, or services.</p></div><div class="support-grid"><div><span>01 / Student access</span><h3>More science in a school day.</h3><p>Help with learning materials, astronomy sessions, or transport for participating school and youth groups.</p></div><div><span>02 / Community astronomy</span><h3>Keep telescope time within reach.</h3><p>Support the astronomers, equipment, and event costs behind planned free community activities.</p></div><div><span>03 / Creative experiences</span><h3>Make room for local ideas.</h3><p>Help a workshop, demonstration, photography session, or artist-led activity become part of the program.</p></div><div><span>04 / A welcoming visit</span><h3>Take care of the practical things.</h3><p>Support suitable spaces, seating, wayfinding, warmth, and other needs as venues are confirmed.</p></div></div><div class="inline-callout"><div><h2>Let’s find a useful fit.</h2><p>Tell us about your organization, what interests you, and the support you have in mind. We can discuss scope, recognition, and next steps together.</p></div><a class="button button-dark" href={emailLink('Sponsorship inquiry')}>Contact the festival <Icon name="arrow" size={20}/></a></div></div></section>
</Layout>
